    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 10 to 15 minutes or until it begins to brown.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-spicy-baked-eggs-with-cheesy-hash/#wprm-recipe-51431-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/spicy-baked-eggs-n-veggie-hash-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the roasted vegetables from the oven and top with shredded Mexican blend cheese.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-spicy-baked-eggs-with-cheesy-hash/#wprm-recipe-51431-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/spicy-baked-eggs-n-veggie-hash-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange the sliced avocado around the veggies, and crack the eggs in the spaces between. Bake for about 10 minutes or until the eggs reach your preferred level of doneness! Top with cotija Cheese, optional jalapeños, and Tajín.",
